## Overview
Implement full state rebuild from events.jsonl source of truth.

## Implementation (src/node/rebuild.ts)

```typescript
async function rebuildState(): Promise<Database> {
  const db = new Database('.kimmi/state.db')

  // Drop and recreate tables
  db.exec('DROP TABLE IF EXISTS nodes; ...')

  // Read and dedupe events
  const events = readEventsSync('.kimmi/events.jsonl')

  // Apply each event
  for (const event of events) {
    applyEvent(db, event)
  }

  // Record cursor
  db.run('INSERT INTO meta (key, value) VALUES (?, ?)',
    ['last_event', events.at(-1)?.id ?? ''])

  return db
}
```

